*Heading
Hash: FU7FqNXE, Date: 11/04/2026, Unit system: MM_TON_S_C
ports_attic.pmx
Multi-zone Acoustics of an attic ROOM:
- 2 x speakers with 2 Helmholtz ports each.
- All walls and furniture as rigid.
a) Use damping curve from measured SPL.
b) Use constant VELO input for transfer function vs REW measured.
c) The spk VELOs must take account of 180deg-phase shit front vs back.
d) Apply Z = (50 * rho_c) on internal speaker walls,
in order to get measured Q width on ports Helmholtz effect.
See model: LHS_spk_ports_Z.pmx
e) del_Freq=5Hz to catch peaks vs measured.
f) mic box with 4 surfaces for poer calcs.
